      "content": "To frame this more positively, you can emphasize the *predictable nature of the trend* despite the current data spread, rather than focusing on the uncertainty itself. You should present the 15-20% confidence interval as a measure of *potential gain* rather than risk, perhaps by showing the best-case and worst-case scenarios of the target outcome. This reframing positions the data as still highly promising, warranting the necessary next investment to confirm the success.",
